{"seq":42,"slug":"prolog-logic-programming","title":"Prolog 逻辑编程语言","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/languages/prolog-logic-programming","rating":{"composite":3.61,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3,"positioning":null,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# Prolog 逻辑编程语言\n\n大多数编程语言要求你描述「怎么算」——一步步把指令排好。Prolog 反其道而行：你描述「什么为真」，剩下的求解交给语言自带的推理引擎。你写下一组事实和规则，提出一个问题，系统就在这些知识里搜索出所有能让问题成立的答案。这种「声明式」的姿态，是 Prolog 与命令式语言、乃至与函数式语言都拉开距离的根源，也是这个 hub 想讲清楚的核心范式。\n\n本 hub 沿四条主线层层递进，每条线对应一个目录，互相之间是「地基→机器→手艺→落地」的依赖关系。\n\n第一条线是 **基础**。它回答三个最根本的问题：为什么要用逻辑去编程，一个 Prolog 程序由什么构成，以及让一切运转起来的那个核心操作——合一——到底是什么。没有这三块地基，后面的执行模型无从谈起。\n\n第二条线是 **执行模型**。同样一段声明式代码，Prolog 是如何「跑」出答案的？这条线拆开引擎的盖子：归结与回溯是它的求解循环，搜索树是这个循环的几何形状，而剪枝与控制则是程序员往这棵树里插入的「剪刀」。理解了执行模型，你才会明白为什么子句顺序会改变行为、为什么有的查询会无限循环。\n\n第三条线是 **编程技术**。地基和引擎备齐之后，这条线教你用 Prolog 真正写出有用的程序：用递归处理列表这一最常见的数据结构，用 `is/2` 做经典算术，用否定与动态谓词在「闭世界」里表达「不成立」和修改运行中的知识库。\n\n第四条线是 **工程实践**。它把前三条线的能力推向真实场景：用 DCG 写出干净的解析器，用约束逻辑编程把「生成-测试」的暴力搜索升级为高效的约束传播，最后用一篇应用与陷阱收束全篇，讲清 Prolog 在 2026 年的现实定位以及那些反复坑人的细节。\n\n读这个 hub 不必从头到尾，但四条线的顺序是经过设计的：每篇文档只深讲属于自己的概念，遇到别处主讲的内容就用一句话点到并交叉链接过去。建议先把基础读透，再带着「引擎在做什么」的视角去读执行模型，后两条线则可按兴趣切入。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/languages/prolog-logic-programming/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-logic-programming","title":"为什么逻辑编程","url":"/h/languages/prolog-logic-programming/foundations/why-logic-programming"},{"seq":2,"slug":"facts-rules-queries","title":"事实、规则与查询","url":"/h/languages/prolog-logic-programming/foundations/facts-rules-queries"},{"seq":3,"slug":"terms-unification","title":"项与合一","url":"/h/languages/prolog-logic-programming/foundations/terms-unification"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"execution","title":"执行模型","docCount":3,"url":"/h/languages/prolog-logic-programming/execution","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"resolution-backtracking","title":"归结与回溯","url":"/h/languages/prolog-logic-programming/execution/resolution-backtracking"},{"seq":2,"slug":"search-tree","title":"搜索树","url":"/h/languages/prolog-logic-programming/execution/search-tree"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cut-control","title":"剪枝与控制","url":"/h/languages/prolog-logic-programming/execution/cut-control"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"techniques","title":"编程技术","docCount":3,"url":"/h/languages/prolog-logic-programming/techniques","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"recursion-lists","title":"递归与列表","url":"/h/languages/prolog-logic-programming/techniques/recursion-lists"},{"seq":2,"slug":"arithmetic-constraints","title":"算术与求值","url":"/h/languages/prolog-logic-programming/techniques/arithmetic-constraints"},{"seq":3,"slug":"negation-assert","title":"否定与动态谓词","url":"/h/languages/prolog-logic-programming/techniques/negation-assert"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/h/languages/prolog-logic-programming/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dcg-parsing","title":"DCG 与解析","url":"/h/languages/prolog-logic-programming/practice/dcg-parsing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"clp-constraint","title":"约束逻辑编程","url":"/h/languages/prolog-logic-programming/practice/clp-constraint"},{"seq":3,"slug":"applications-pitfalls","title":"应用与陷阱","url":"/h/languages/prolog-logic-programming/practice/applications-pitfalls"}]}]}